<title>USA: Merrill Lynch files $11 bln debt shelf.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch files $11 bln debt shelf.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co filed Thursday with the Securities and Exchange Commission a shelf registration to sell up to $11 billion in debt securities.</p>
<p>When combined with a previous registration, Merill will have a total offering of $13,844,572,000 in securities available for sale.  </p>
<p>Net proceeds will be used for general corporate purposes, the company said in the filing.</p>
</text>
